Nemonix made the KZCCA series of devices for the StorageWorks group in DEC.

Nemonix still make such devices, now in both HVD (for HSZ and other
StorageWorks type applications) and LVD/SE variants.

The boards come as SCSI only, Fast Ethernet only or Combo boards. For
smaller VAXes they generally plug into the CDAL bus on the CPU board.
Regrettably they don't do one for the VAX 4000-200 or 4000-300. There is
also an XMI bus version.

