Success!  First, thanks everyone for your help.  I booted the machine and 
watched the LCD.  A memory test failure flashed by, then it stuck in an 
endless loop testing both CPUs.  I took that "opportunity" to check all the 
fans for a duration.  Everything was fine.  I had moved the server 
recentrly (across town) so I decided to pull all the components, check for 
burnt parts and re-seat everything.  Et Voila!  It is working perfectly.  
Well, ok, not perfectly.  The CD-ROM drive won't read any media anymore and 
the tray always pops open.  But that is probably deserving of a new thread 
in a different group!

Thanks,
Doug


